      "intro": "After {{yn}} (in) the first letter changes: {{Cymru}} becomes {{Nghymru}} and {{yn}} becomes {{yng}}; {{gogledd}} becomes {{ngogledd}}; {{de}} becomes {{ne}}; {{dwyrain}} becomes {{nwyrain}}.",
